OL,3,GNEWSADivided executive 'speaking as
OL,4,Aone' on budget, says finance minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Finance Minister has said, despite
OL,7,F"tensions around the table", the
OL,8,Fexecutive is focused on "speaking as
OL,9,Fone" to secure a better budget for
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,12,FSinn Fein's John O'Dowd said the
OL,13,Fexecutive needs "movement" from the
OL,14,Fgovernment to set a Stormont budget as
OL,15,Fit does not have the "quantum of
OL,16,Ffunding" nor the "terms conditions"
OL,17,Fnecessary to reach an agreement.
OL,19,FMinisters met with the secretary of
OL,20,Fstate on Friday but it ended without
OL,21,Fany resolution to the budget crisis.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
