OL,3,GNEWSADivided executive 'speaking as
OL,4,Aone' on budget, says finance minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Chris Bryant, who has said there
OL,7,Fwas "no more money" available, earlier
OL,8,Fthis week accused executive ministers
OL,9,Fof being financially "irresponsible".
